WEBVTT

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:14.425
[song ends]

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:16.645
[people screaming][Knuckles] What happened here?

00:00:16.819 --> 00:00:18.734
[Sonic] Looks like GUN
got their butts kicked.

00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:21.215
Keep your eyes open.
Tails, anything?

00:00:21.389 --> 00:00:23.913
Whoa! These energy readings
are off the charts!

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:25.828
[loud crashing]

00:00:26.002 --> 00:00:28.004
[Sonic] Look out![Knuckles grunts]

00:00:29.353 --> 00:00:32.704
One... million...
percent.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.272
[truck crashes]

00:00:36.099 --> 00:00:37.361
[heavy footfalls]

00:00:45.848 --> 00:00:48.416
Whoa! Are you guys seeing this?

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:51.158
- He looks just like you.
- Impossible!

00:00:51.332 --> 00:00:52.986
You're a colorful bunch.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.554
Um, excuse me.
Why do you look like me?

00:00:56.728 --> 00:00:58.121
I don't look like you.

00:00:58.295 --> 00:01:01.124
You look like me!
Why do you look like me?

00:01:01.298 --> 00:01:04.998
Hey, you know what?
I'll ask the questions,
new hedgehog!

00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:07.174
Who are you?
Why do you look like me?

00:01:07.348 --> 00:01:09.176
This is a waste of time.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:11.961
Walk away,
before you get hurt.

00:01:12.135 --> 00:01:13.745
Whoa, whoa, easy, buddy.

00:01:15.051 --> 00:01:16.792
We don't want to fight you.

00:01:16.966 --> 00:01:19.664
Actually, Sonic,
I would like to fight.

00:01:19.839 --> 00:01:21.275
Not now.[Knuckles growls]

00:01:21.449 --> 00:01:23.190
Why don't you stop throwing cars
at us for a second

00:01:23.364 --> 00:01:24.800
and come down here to talk?

00:01:24.974 --> 00:01:27.542
You jumped
out of a GUN helicopter.

00:01:27.716 --> 00:01:29.674
There's nothing
to talk about.

00:01:29.849 --> 00:01:31.720
All right, then. Enough!

00:01:31.894 --> 00:01:33.113
Knuckles, no!

00:01:33.287 --> 00:01:35.855
Let us talk with our fists!

00:01:40.207 --> 00:01:42.209
[fist crunching][yells]

00:01:42.818 --> 00:01:43.863
[grunts]

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.128
[grunts sharply]

00:01:50.695 --> 00:01:51.871
[both] Knuckles!

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:54.221
Knuckles!
Knuckles, are you okay?

00:01:54.395 --> 00:01:55.613
No, not really. Ow!

00:01:58.181 --> 00:01:59.704
[Tails] Who is this guy?

00:01:59.879 --> 00:02:01.054
He is much more impressive

00:02:01.228 --> 00:02:03.056
than the hedgehog
I fought previously.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.319
Dude,
I'm standing right here.

00:02:05.493 --> 00:02:08.888
Now, come on!
He can't take us all at once.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:10.846
[Tails] Ow![Knuckles grunts]

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.021
[Sonic grunts]

00:02:14.894 --> 00:02:15.938
[yelling]

00:02:18.898 --> 00:02:21.422
[breathless] Okay,
he took us all at once.

00:02:21.596 --> 00:02:22.553
Weakling.

00:02:22.727 --> 00:02:24.164
[groans]

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:28.124
Don't try to follow me.

00:02:28.298 --> 00:02:29.821
[motor revving]

00:02:31.911 --> 00:02:34.043
Sonic, I know that look.

00:02:34.217 --> 00:02:36.045
Going after him
is a bad idea.

00:02:36.219 --> 00:02:38.482
When has that ever stopped me?

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:44.358
I got to ask,
one hedgehog to another,

00:02:44.532 --> 00:02:45.576
who does your highlights?

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:46.621
[growls]

00:02:51.452 --> 00:02:52.627
[horn blares]

00:02:54.411 --> 00:02:57.806
Hey! Dangerously weaving
through traffic is my thing!

00:02:58.894 --> 00:03:00.243
[loud grunt]

00:03:04.378 --> 00:03:05.814
Coming through!

00:03:07.337 --> 00:03:08.208
[yelps]

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:12.299
Why are you running away?
We were just getting started.

00:03:12.473 --> 00:03:13.387
[both shriek]

00:03:14.475 --> 00:03:15.824
The more you talk,

00:03:15.998 --> 00:03:17.782
the harder
I want to hit you.

00:03:19.828 --> 00:03:21.351
[yelling]

00:03:21.525 --> 00:03:22.874
Watch out!

00:03:24.311 --> 00:03:26.269
Ugh, I'm gonna throw up!

00:03:26.878 --> 00:03:28.315
[motor revving]

00:03:28.489 --> 00:03:30.708
Yeah, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:34.277
Yah!

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:43.765
[grunting heavily]

00:04:07.267 --> 00:04:09.921
[machinery powering on]

00:04:11.358 --> 00:04:15.231
[groans] 1.21 gigawatts.

00:04:15.405 --> 00:04:16.754
[metal clinking]

00:04:18.843 --> 00:04:20.976
Oh, you've got to be kidding me!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:21.890
[Tails] Sonic!

00:04:22.064 --> 00:04:23.239
Are you okay?

00:04:23.413 --> 00:04:25.328
I'm fine, guys.
And before you ask,

00:04:25.502 --> 00:04:27.374
I handcuffed myself
for tactical reasons

00:04:27.548 --> 00:04:29.289
that I do not have time
to explain.

00:04:29.463 --> 00:04:31.334
You shouldn't have gone off
on your own.

00:04:31.508 --> 00:04:33.206
We're supposed to be a team.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.599
Sorry, buddy.
I'm still working
on this teamwork thing.

00:04:35.773 --> 00:04:37.297
So now what?

00:04:37.471 --> 00:04:39.647
Well, I'm not jumping
out of any more helicopters

00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:41.823
until we get some answers
from GUN.

00:04:41.997 --> 00:04:43.564
We need somewhere to regroup.

00:04:45.087 --> 00:04:46.915
I know just the place.

00:04:47.089 --> 00:04:49.483
["Lollipop"
by TEMPURA KIDZ playing]

00:04:55.097 --> 00:04:56.664
[all clapping]

00:04:57.447 --> 00:04:59.188
<i>Hai, chiizu.</i>[yelps]

00:04:59.362 --> 00:05:00.624
It's an ambush!

00:05:00.798 --> 00:05:02.800
You'll never take us alive,
foul beasts!

00:05:02.974 --> 00:05:05.325
Calm down, Knuckles.
This is a Chao Garden.

00:05:05.499 --> 00:05:08.589
One of the top ten must-see
spots in all of Tokyo!

00:05:08.763 --> 00:05:10.678
It's a perfect place
for us to blend in.

00:05:10.852 --> 00:05:12.506
Are you Detective Pikachu?

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.116
Yes, he is!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.250
[chortles] He does
look like a Pokémon.

00:05:17.424 --> 00:05:18.381
"Pika, pika!" [laughs]

00:05:18.555 --> 00:05:20.340
Commander Walters!

00:05:20.514 --> 00:05:22.298
Sonic.

00:05:22.472 --> 00:05:25.214
Thank God you're all okay.
I'm sure you have questions.

00:05:25.388 --> 00:05:28.087
Just a big ticked-off
red and black one.

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:29.653
Who was that guy?

00:05:29.827 --> 00:05:32.526
Shadow's story
began a lot like yours, Sonic.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:35.485
But where you found family
and friends on this planet,

00:05:35.659 --> 00:05:39.185
Shadow found only pain and loss.

00:05:39.924 --> 00:05:42.275
<i>It begins over 50 years ago,</i>

00:05:42.449 --> 00:05:45.582
<i>with a meteor crash
in a quiet corner of Oklahoma.</i>

00:05:45.756 --> 00:05:49.369
<i>The meteorite contained
a life-form.</i>

00:05:52.111 --> 00:05:53.895
<i>The ultimate life-form.</i>

00:05:55.897 --> 00:05:58.378
<i>Shadow's power--
his "chaos energy"--</i>

00:05:58.552 --> 00:06:01.555
<i>went far beyond
any living creature.</i>

00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:06.734
<i>The scientist
who discovered him
believed this power</i>

00:06:06.908 --> 00:06:09.084
<i>would usher in a new era
for humanity.</i>

00:06:10.607 --> 00:06:13.741
<i>But Shadow's power
proved too dangerous.</i>

00:06:16.657 --> 00:06:18.659
<i>A terrible accident
destroyed the lab,</i>

00:06:18.833 --> 00:06:21.096
<i>taking human lives with it.</i>[siren wailing]

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:25.535
<i>The project leader
was blamed for the incident
and imprisoned.</i>

00:06:25.709 --> 00:06:27.363
<i>With the program canceled...</i>[yelps in pain]

00:06:27.537 --> 00:06:30.497
<i>...Shadow was a loose end
no one knew how to deal with.</i>

00:06:31.759 --> 00:06:33.674
<i>Too dangerous
to be walking free,</i>

00:06:33.848 --> 00:06:36.198
<i>too valuable to destroy.</i>

00:06:37.286 --> 00:06:39.462
<i>So I had him placed
into stasis...</i>

00:06:42.161 --> 00:06:44.163
<i>indefinitely.</i>

00:06:46.165 --> 00:06:49.255
Wait a second. If Shadow's
been on ice for 50 years,

00:06:49.429 --> 00:06:51.692
- someone had to help him escape.
- True.

00:06:51.866 --> 00:06:53.520
But there's only a few people
in the world

00:06:53.694 --> 00:06:55.565
who even know
of Shadow's existence.

00:07:02.659 --> 00:07:05.532
[J-pop cover of
"I Want You Back"
by Jackson 5 playing]

00:07:05.706 --> 00:07:07.882
[people cheering]

00:07:11.668 --> 00:07:14.105
A live show? Yeah!

00:07:17.848 --> 00:07:19.850
[drones humming]

00:07:23.419 --> 00:07:24.420
Get down!

00:07:30.426 --> 00:07:33.603
[people screaming]

00:07:34.778 --> 00:07:36.650
[groaning]

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.393
Egg drones?

00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:43.265
But Robotnik
is supposed to be dead!

